Modifications made in Decibel relative to FineTune:

  - Renamed and rebranded throughout, including the bundle identifier
    (com.finetuneapp.* -> com.decibelapp.*) and the decibel:// URL scheme.
  - Repointed the Sparkle update feed, repository links and project metadata
    to github.com/LorenzoGalaverna/Decibel, and generated a new EdDSA key
    pair for signing updates.
  - Replaced the release pipeline: builds are ad-hoc signed rather than
    notarized with an Apple Developer ID, so no paid Apple account is needed.
  - Removed the upstream project's funding links.

